*** Settings ***
Library    Process
Documentation    This file defined helper to execute CMake build from Robot Framework tests.
...              To use it in your tests add this file as resource inside Settings section:
...              *** Settings ***
...              Resource    ${ep_app_dir}/cmake.resource

*** Keywords ***
CMake build
    [Documentation]   Build the specified target using CMake. 
    ...               ${build_dir} is th directory where the build files are located (generated by CMake configure step).
    ...               ${build_target} is the name of the target to build (defined in the CMakeLists.txt with add_executable).
    ...               If ${clean} is set to True, the build will be cleaned (--clean-first) before building the target.
    [Arguments]  ${build_dir}    ${build_target}    ${clean}=False
    ${clean_build_arg} =    Set Variable If    ${clean}    --clean-first    ${EMPTY}
    Log To Console     \nCompiling target ${build_target}
    ${result} =   Run Process   cmake    --build    ${build_dir}    --target    ${build_target}    ${clean_build_arg}    stderr=STDOUT
    Log    ${result.stdout}
    IF    ${result.rc} != 0
        Log To Console    \n${result.stdout}
        Fail    Build failed with return code ${result.rc}
    END

    
    